sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as CLI Command Parser
    participant CLIENT as HTTP Client
    participant SERVER as HTTP Server Handler
    participant UC as Transaction Use Case
    participant VAL as Validation (application)
    participant CREPO as Category Repository
    participant TREPO as Transaction Repository
    participant STORE as Local Storage

    User->>CLI: add --type expense --amount "10000" --category food --date 2026-03-28
    CLI->>CLI: Parse flags and normalize amount to amountMinor

    CLI->>CLIENT: Serialize request to JSON
    CLIENT->>SERVER: POST /transactions (localhost HTTP)

    SERVER->>SERVER: Decode JSON body and basic field checks
    SERVER->>UC: AddTransaction(type, amountMinor, category, date, description)

    UC->>VAL: ParseEntryType, validate amountMinor > 0, NormalizeCategory, ParseISODate
    VAL-->>UC: Validated inputs

    UC->>CREPO: GetByNormalizedKey(category)
    CREPO-->>UC: Category found

    UC->>TREPO: Create(transaction entity with ULID)
    TREPO->>STORE: Persist local-only data
    STORE-->>TREPO: Saved
    TREPO-->>UC: Success

    UC-->>SERVER: Transaction entity
    SERVER-->>CLIENT: HTTP 201 + JSend success
    CLIENT-->>CLI: Deserialize response
    CLI-->>User: English confirmation output

    alt Validation error (type/amount/category/date)
        UC-->>SERVER: DomainError {code, message, field?, hint?}
        SERVER-->>CLIENT: HTTP 400 + JSend fail
        CLIENT-->>CLI: Deserialize error
        CLI-->>User: Show structured error in English (exit code 2)
    end

    alt Server / storage error
        SERVER-->>CLIENT: HTTP 5xx + JSend error
        CLIENT-->>CLI: Deserialize error
        CLI-->>User: Show server error message (exit code 3)
    end
